    "article_summary": "The article describes a method for the direct incorporation of tertiary alkyl substituents into electron-deficient nitrogen heteroarenes using tert-alkyl oxalate salts as radical precursors. The reaction is initiated by either visible-light photoredox catalysis (using an iridium or organic photocatalyst) or thermal activation, providing a broad scope of alkylated heterocycles under mild conditions.",
